activity-relay (2.4.0~rc1-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Accept valid signed public activities from unsubscribed publishers.
  * Track observed publishers and expose publisher status metadata.
  * Publish maintained multi-architecture containers from tagged releases.
  * Adopt the maintained github.com/thystra/Activity-Relay Go module path.

  * Remove legacy upstream CLI branding and expose the compiled version.

