activity-relay (2.3.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Add concurrency-safe and indexed relay state snapshots.
  * Reduce Redis load with SCAN, pipelined reads, and bounded fan-out.
  * Add atomic queue admission and bounded remote HTTP responses.
  * Add opt-in HTTP/3 configuration guidance for Nginx.

 -- thystra <noreply@github.com>  Wed, 22 Jul 2026 21:30:00 -0400

activity-relay (2.2.0) noble; urgency=medium

